    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Phil,<div><br></div><div>yes, you understood everything perfectly well and using generate.mirt_object() worked perfectly.</div><div><br></div><div>For future users:</div><div>This is what the new code would look like (minimal working example):</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#008\">require</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;mirtCAT&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#generate some random answers</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>V1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">99</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  V1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cbind</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">V1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#define</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> df </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dataset containing </span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> answers </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rows</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> items </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">columns</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">V1<br>colnames</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#define</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mirt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">model </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> the </span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> items<br>model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mirt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;F1 = 1-50<br>                    F2 = 51-100&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#calculate model for 100 items</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>full_model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mirt</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">guess</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> method</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;EM&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">technical</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NCYCLES</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">15</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">##Now lets insert the type-none-item</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#get coefficients for the 100 items</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>mod_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">coef</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">full_model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> simplify</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$items<br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#create a coefficients row for the type-none-item</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>mod_none_questions</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">NA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ncol</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ncol</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mod_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#bind everything together in the appropriate order</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>mod_ges</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rbind</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mod_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">50</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,],</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mod_none_questions</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mod_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">51</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#create final model for mirtCAT</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>mod_final </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> generate</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mirt_object</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mod_ges</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> itemtype </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;2PL&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> nrow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mod_ges</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#check results</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>coef</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mod_final</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">simplify</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>Additionally I created a custom NextItemFunction to make sure the CAT will first choose from items 1:50, then administer the type-none-question and the choose from items 52:101.</div><div><br></div><div>Best, Daniel</div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
